Hey, Everett

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:35.870
anata no sekai de watashi wa ittai dou natteru no

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:35.870
What am I like in your world?

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:38.830
sukoshi nozokasete

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:38.830
Let me take a peek

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:40.290
nee everetto

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:40.290
Hey, Everett

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:44.250
anata no iu niwa sekai tottemo takusan aru tte

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:44.250
According to you, there are lots of different worlds

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:47.170
chotto yoku wakaranai no

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:47.170
I'm not sure I understand

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:49.130
"Hi, Dandy"

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:51.050
"Hello"

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:53.140
"How are you doing?"

00:22:54.390 --> 00:22:56.100
nee Ph. D.

00:22:54.390 --> 00:22:56.100
Hey, Ph. D.

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:59.850
kasanaru sekai wa itsu made tatte mo heikousen da wa

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:59.850
The alternate worlds will always be parallel

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:03.110
atama ga panku shichaisou yo

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:03.110
It's enough to blow my mind

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:08.820
aa samete wa kataku nari

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:08.820
Oh, once it cools, it hardens

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:12.780
nessureba tokete yuku

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:12.780
When heated, it melts

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:16.040
kono yo wa kotowari darake de

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:16.040
This world is so full of rules,

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:18.700
dame ni natchaisou ne

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:18.700
it's gonna fall apart

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:22.960
ichi jigen ni jigen san jigen

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:22.960
One dimension, two dimensions, three dimensions

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:26.960
nishi kara higashi e nagareru choushinsei

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:26.960
A supernova falling from west to east

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.590
easy game, easy game,

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:31.130
too Easy Game

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:35.720
iki wa yoiyoi kaeri wa dou natta

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:35.720
Going is fine, but what about coming home?

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:40.600
aa samenai yume no yume

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:40.600
Oh, the dream of a never-ending dream

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:45.480
torokesou na mirukii kissu

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:45.480
A melty, milky kiss

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:52.030
kono yo wa doko made mo fukurande yuku no

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:52.030
How far will this world expand?

